# Normalize line endings across platforms: store text as LF in the repo and
# check out LF everywhere. Prevents the "whole repo looks modified" churn that
# happens when a Windows checkout (CRLF) is read by Linux tooling/CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp4 binary
